# Build artifacts. Binaries and packages never get committed; releases ship
# from CI, and `termcade dev build` writes into <game>/build/.
/bin/
/dist/
games/*/build/
*.tcade
# …except the starter pack: embedded in the binary, so remote module builds
# (`go run …@latest`) only see committed files. Content assets, not build
# output — regenerate with `go generate ./internal/starter`.
!internal/starter/packs/*.tcade
game.wasm
